WEBVTT

00:12:58.544 --> 00:13:00.916
for a poor, barefooted boy

00:13:01.747 --> 00:13:03.416
to dream that one day,

00:13:04.773 --> 00:13:07.440
he would meet Martin Luther King, Jr.

00:13:07.464 --> 00:13:10.668
I remember so well when he said,

00:13:10.692 --> 00:13:12.551
"Are you the boy from Troy?

00:13:13.453 --> 00:13:15.696
Are you John Lewis?"

00:13:17.315 --> 00:13:18.527
And I said,

00:13:19.480 --> 00:13:23.180
"Dr. King, I am John Robert Lewis."

00:13:24.005 --> 00:13:26.771
And he called me "the boy from Troy."

00:13:26.795 --> 00:13:29.557
"How is the boy from Troy doing?"